hackios-thyme

Two licenses apply, by directory — the same split the base HakiOS project uses:

1. The kernel-side material: everything under src/kernel-patches/ is a description of modifications
   to files that are themselves a derivative work of Apple's XNU (the port's kernel tree), and is
   therefore licensed under the **Apple Public Source License, Version 2.0** — the full text is in
   LICENSE.APSL. Per its terms these modifications are published here as source, and the notices
   that belong to the modified files stay with them (they are not copied here).

2. Everything else that is ours — the documentation, the scripts, the build tools, src/sideload.c,
   the loader patch in scripts/loader-autoboot.patch and the tools/ helpers — is licensed under the
   **MIT License** below.

Third-party components and their licenses are listed in NOTICE.md. Apple's operating system and its
firmware images (IPSW), Apple's trademarks, and the phone's own firmware are **not** part of this
repository and are not licensed by it; every user obtains them from their own device and their own
copy of the software.

